## 📌 Project Overview
An executive-level People Analytics & Retention solution built in Power BI, analyzing workforce demographics, employee attrition drivers, cost of turnover, and survival flight risk across 4,820 FTEs.

---

## 📊 Dashboard Pages & Architecture
1. **Executive Summary Dashboard**:
   - High-level KPIs: Active Headcount (4,820), Rolling Attrition (11.4%), Open Requisitions (142), eNPS (+46), Workforce Cost ($418.5M).
   - Inflow/Outflow hiring vs. exit trend lines.
   - Tenure vs. Performance early-warning flight risk matrix.
   - Pareto exit survey drivers (Compensation & Career Growth account for 62% of exits).

2. **Attrition & Retention Diagnostics**:
   - Kaplan-Meier Tenure Survival Curve pinpointing Month 14 post-cliff dropouts.
   - Department vs. Job Level attrition heatmap.
   - Commute distance vs. Overtime burnout correlation scatter plot.
   - Machine Learning flight-risk intervention dispatch table.

