## 🗄️ Data Model (Star Schema)
- **Fact Tables**: `Fact_WorkforceMonthly`, `Fact_Terminations`
- **Dimension Tables**: `Dim_Employee`, `Dim_Department`, `Dim_Date`, `Dim_JobRole`, `Dim_ExitSurvey`

